(6614735, 987593, 96751, '<td valign="top">They say that after we''re gone, it will only take 1,000 years for the earth to re-absorbe everything we put on it.  Then it''s back to jungles :-)</td>', 'They say that after we''re gone, it will only take 1,000 years for the earth to re-absorbe everything we put on it.  Then it''s back to jungles :-)', '2011-12-09 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
