(6614852, 987578, 109387, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s Judi''s style, am I wrong? If I am wrong please forgive me.<br/> <br/>Well, I like the idea but not the editing. Shadows are wrong (there is a low sun on the horizon and shadows should be much longer) and on the left almost unreal. There are rays of light on the building but they can''t come from there. They should come much more from the direction of the sun that is almost visible on the center left of the image.</td>', 'Looks like it''s Judi''s style, am I wrong? If I am wrong please forgive me. Well, I like the idea but not the editing. Shadows are wrong (there is a low sun on the horizon and shadows should be much longer) and on the left almost unreal. There are rays of light on the building but they can''t come from there. They should come much more from the direction of the sun that is almost visible on the center left of the image.', '2011-12-09 04:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
