(6615098, 987538, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is just beyond excellent, Lev. It''s poignant and haunting. You will finish second to what I assume is Gyaban''s "Heartless" creation, which is also excellent, but slightly lacking in heart, as it were, which this one has in abundance. The earbud-balloon is an inspired stroke. The backstory here just grows and grows until it dawns like some sort of new age. Well done!</td>', 'This is just beyond excellent, Lev. It''s poignant and haunting. You will finish second to what I assume is Gyaban''s "Heartless" creation, which is also excellent, but slightly lacking in heart, as it were, which this one has in abundance. The earbud-balloon is an inspired stroke. The backstory here just grows and grows until it dawns like some sort of new age. Well done!', '2011-12-09 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
