(6615502, 987594, 93565, '<td valign="top">Odd, but very well done. This makes me think of something out of a Tool video like the video for <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=UUXBCdt5IPg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Vicarious</a>. I mean that as a big compliment- they have pretty interesting and insane videos. Nicely done- the scenes mesh together wonderfully, which is always the hardest part to accomplish.</td>', 'Odd, but very well done. This makes me think of something out of a Tool video like the video for Vicarious. I mean that as a big compliment- they have pretty interesting and insane videos. Nicely done- the scenes mesh together wonderfully, which is always the hardest part to accomplish.', '2011-12-10 09:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
