(6779984, 986979, 124255, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, the road is fits well with the shot but I think the sky looks like a traditional photograph which, for me, takes away from the dreamy feeling you were probably going for. <br/> <br/>I gave it a 4 during voting- I don''t do that unless something bothers me, I don''t remember my thoughts but it was probably the sky<br/> <br/>nice attempt though, and overall most liked it - above 6 is pretty darn good <br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting idea, the road is fits well with the shot but I think the sky looks like a traditional photograph which, for me, takes away from the dreamy feeling you were probably going for.  I gave it a 4 during voting- I don''t do that unless something bothers me, I don''t remember my thoughts but it was probably the sky nice attempt though, and overall most liked it - above 6 is pretty darn good  ', '2012-05-28 12:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
